{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791380520, "covers_from": "2026-10-07T13:42:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-07T13:43:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791380580, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46402, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "去健身房的路是林森北路從民族到長春。沿途上任何時段永遠有躲不完的二手煙味。明明要健身身體都不好了。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.46,402", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43694, "sprite_key": "penguin_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "邊走邊抽菸很討人厭，路人被迫吸二手菸。所以邊走邊抽煙要禁止。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.43,694", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35294, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "不要亂砍樹木, 不要隨便修剪樹木、要有遮蔭美觀樹木", "display_name": "士林代表 No.35,294", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:32+00:00", "duration_seconds": 5, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28687, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "老鼠太頻繁出現在公共場域", "display_name": "信義代表 No.28,687", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 36968, "sprite_key": "deer_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "文化", "content": "轉型正義未完成，陳文成和林宅血案未破案，中正廟要拆除，不義遺址要保存完整，要做人權教育。", "display_name": "信義代表 No.36,968", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-07T13:42:51+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 19490, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "啊！！！為什麼木柵公園在砍樹！！！啊！！！！！", "display_name": "文山代表 No.19,490", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_numbe